@startuml State_Submission
!theme plain

title State Diagram: Trang thai Submission

[*] --> QU : User nop bai

state "QU\n(Queued)" as QU : Bai dang cho\ntrong hang doi
state "P\n(Processing)" as P : Judge da nhan\ndang chuan bi
state "G\n(Grading)" as G : Dang cham\ntung test case
state "D\n(Done)" as D : Cham xong\nco ket qua
state "CE\n(Compile Error)" as CE : Loi bien dich
state "AB\n(Aborted)" as AB : Bi huy

QU --> P : Judge nhan submission\n(submission-processing)
QU --> AB : User/Admin huy

P --> G : Bien dich thanh cong\n(grading-begin)
P --> CE : Bien dich loi\n(compile-error)

G --> G : Moi test case\n(test-case-status)
G --> D : Tat ca test da chay\n(grading-end)

D --> [*]
CE --> [*]
AB --> [*]

note right of D
  **Result codes khi Done:**
  AC - Accepted (Dung)
  WA - Wrong Answer (Sai)
  TLE - Time Limit Exceeded
  MLE - Memory Limit Exceeded
  RTE - Runtime Error
  OLE - Output Limit Exceeded
  IR - Invalid Return
  SC - Short Circuit
  IE - Internal Error
end note

== Rejudge ==

D --> QU : Admin rejudge\n(reset status)

@enduml
